description:
For this edition of Legends Week, we headed to Ischgl, Austria, where 19 creators from around the world came together for three days of skiing, snowboarding, creativity, and unforgettable moments on the slopes. From high speed runs to après ski sessions, watch how they turned the mountains into their playground with Insta360.

Participating creators (in no particular order):
@andreasardovideo
@matthiaswegeradventure
@artai_
